          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हुरहूर — hurhūr — \"a wistful unease\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शाळेचा शेवटचा दिवस होता, मनात हुरहूर होती. śāḷecā śevaṭcā divas hotā, manāt hurhūr hotī. It was the last day of school, and there was an ache in the heart."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The ache at an ending or a parting: हुरहूर (hurhūr) लागणे, with the dative."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
